---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4 bg-white">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-14 max-w-6xl my-14 md:my-16 lg:my-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center">
                Why Work with Warehouster?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-5xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                <span class="text-gray-600">Choosing the right partner for warehouse development can turn vision into lasting value.</span> At Warehouster, we engineer scalable, future-ready logistics infrastructure that fuels operational excellence and growth. Our institutional-grade planning and local market insight ensure every phase—from site selection to handover—is executed with precision, transparency, and speed.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5">
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-[#f8f8f8] border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-1.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-1" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Single-Point Accountability
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-base lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            From inception to handover, we ensure smooth, transparent coordination.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-[#f8f8f8] border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-2.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-2" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Global Standards, Local Execution
                        </h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            We bring international best practices adapted to Indian market dynamics.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5">
                <div class="w-full md:w-[33%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-[#f8f8f8] border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-3.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-3" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Scalable Solutions
                        </h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Whether 50,000 sq ft or 2 million sq ft, our systems adapt accordingly.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-[33%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-[#f8f8f8] border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-4.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-4" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Trusted Partnerships
                        </h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                           We collaborate with industry leaders in construction, logistics, and financing.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-[33%] py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-[#f8f8f8] border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#ffb485]">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-[#F6670B] flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/asset-manag-icon-5.webp" alt="asset-manag-icon-5" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">
                            Proven Track Record
                        </h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Each warehouse project is a testament to our commitment to quality and timeline adherence. 
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>

